<main class="wrap1 txt legal-page"><nav class="crumb"><a href="./">Home</a> / Privacy policy</nav><h1 class="ph1">Privacy Policy</h1><p class="fine">Last updated: 24 November 2026</p>
<p>Skye African Supermarket uses personal information to take and fulfil orders, respond to enquiries, manage the store and, where you opt in, send store emails.</p>
<h2>Information we collect</h2><p>Depending on how you use the site, we may collect your name, phone number, email address, delivery address and postcode, order contents, payment method and messages or notes you provide. The site also receives basic technical information needed to operate and protect it, such as IP address and browser session data.</p>
<h2>How we use it</h2><p>We use order details to process and confirm orders, arrange collection or delivery, handle substitutions, returns and refunds, and answer questions. We use admin account information to secure and operate the store dashboard. Newsletter addresses are used only after you give consent and confirm your email.</p>
<h2>Payments and WhatsApp</h2><p>The store does not process card payments through this website. Bank transfer receipts are sent by customers through WhatsApp when they choose that payment method. WhatsApp is operated by a separate provider and its own privacy terms apply to information you share there.</p>
<h2>Sharing and retention</h2><p>We share information only as needed to operate the store, fulfil an order, provide communications or comply with legal obligations. Order and transaction records are kept for the periods needed for accounting, customer service and legal requirements. Newsletter information is kept until you unsubscribe or withdraw consent.</p>
<h2>Your choices</h2><p>You can unsubscribe from store emails using the unsubscribe link in the confirmation email. You can contact us to ask about the personal information held about you, correct it, or request deletion where applicable. Some order records may need to be retained for legal or accounting reasons.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions, contact us at <a href="mailto:support@skyeafricansupermarket.com">support@skyeafricansupermarket.com</a> or on <a href="https://wa.me/<?=e(wa_number())?>">WhatsApp <?=e(wa_display())?></a>. Store address: <?=e(shop_address())?>.</p>
